{"title":"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/3/d43b1eced5df69a52b34eb82bbf32bdfa24e8653.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CAT$\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/2/462a45a4a40c52b79e0fc8cd033b28e9a6f03e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACT =\\angle ATC$\" width=\"132\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/83125b82e6f4f9249f27ae719dfcbb002385aca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAT = 36^\\circ$\" width=\"102\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7f34bc70da7fbd0b6e30043f036cf4e0a459384.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{TR}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> bisects  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f749b6fa739d8993b305133bc976db9ad2150c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ATC$\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5611951a2da41e9913b7f166fe58bc710218fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CRT =$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/d/1cd5fcdd096a6909d3a0d285a1104ddd1d681c74.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,C,T,R; C = (0,0); T = (2,0); A = (1,sqrt(5+sqrt(20))); R = (3/2 - sqrt(5)/2,1.175570); draw(C--A--T--cycle); draw(T--R); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$T$&quot;,T,SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SW); label(&quot;$R$&quot;,R,NW);[/asy]\" width=\"178\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/3/db37e77bac19412929c3ca28b813c3fd83df73cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 36^\\circ\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ 54^\\circ\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ 72^\\circ\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ 90^\\circ\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ 108^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/4/8b4ab60164fbdb15e36828a86fd86c4e5bc1a51a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ACT$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, the three angles sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c4460b5100c3ce982ab5ebb20a8c3871e9cfdc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/f/e6f784129f9f1d97947bf971de9bd53651cc087e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C = \\angle T$\" width=\"77\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/d/afd8667897194ec4dd767c4b39bcca7c05f527b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAT + \\angle ATC + \\angle ACT = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"260\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/3/7a350cfc06b7ba4baae3569e7dba951b31235eaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 + \\angle ATC + \\angle ATC = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"221\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/7/7d7aef9aac5b0b308f48fc83b1288b8f27c9a248.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\angle ATC = 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"114\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3bb0b19a7f4f9403fa0a25b52866c917f15c677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ATC = 72$\" width=\"95\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f749b6fa739d8993b305133bc976db9ad2150c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ATC$\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" /> is bisected by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7f34bc70da7fbd0b6e30043f036cf4e0a459384.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{TR}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e7fdd2fd5f53558293bfc80205c8cee2ac70da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle RTC = \\frac{72}{2} = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"142\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Now focusing on the smaller <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44e3214b8968b0b5f27507591b09a0dd219fc02f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle RTC$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, the sum of the angles in that triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c4460b5100c3ce982ab5ebb20a8c3871e9cfdc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79bc319f374b0e779d503400c603ca2db3e3756.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle RTC + \\angle TCR + \\angle CRT = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"258\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/68437a20ab92478cd8bfaeac66744dd7afa0ffc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 + \\angle ACT + \\angle CRT = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"221\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10dc49c1f02876b1e23d7190bc6024eedd0c0524.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 + \\angle ATC + \\angle CRT = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"224\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/d/b4dfdf9d70fd37fc8826d54ef5790e25cd5b1f31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 + 72 + \\angle CRT = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"186\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f055241fdd84bb24fb165bf958d7065281a76448.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CRT = 72^\\circ$\" width=\"102\" height=\"13\" />, giving the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 8\">2000 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2000\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 AMC 